    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Ten million "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "overseas",
            "ref": "v-overseas"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " views, 73 countries, and 11 different languages. These are the incredible numbers behind the latest Chinese TV hit, "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Swords Into Plowshares"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "《太平年》"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". In China, fans are cheering, “Finally, a real history show! Every drama should follow this standard!” At the same time, the show has gone viral abroad. From Cannes to Tokyo, it is breaking records and proving that ancient Chinese stories can become global "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "blockbusters",
            "zh": "风靡全球的佳作"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "What makes "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Swords Into Plowshares"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " so special? The secret lies in the production team’s genuine "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "dedication",
            "zh": "真诚投入"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". To recreate the world of the 10th century, the team paid attention to every detail. They built 38,000 square metres of sets and made more than 8,000 sets of costumes. They even made metal "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "armor",
            "zh": "盔甲"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " by hand that weighed over 20 kilograms! Every detail, down to the hair on a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "wig",
            "zh": "假发"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and the patterns on a robe, is true to history. The show is like a time machine that lets the audience step into the stormy era of ancient China."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "However, what moves the audience most is its call for peace. While many war dramas focus on winning battles, "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Swords Into Plowshares"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "emphasises",
            "ref": "v-emphasise"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the importance of ending "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "chaos",
            "zh": "混乱"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The heroes don’t fight for power or "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "glory",
            "ref": "v-glory"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Instead, they struggle to stop wars so that ordinary people can finally live in peace. For example, "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Zhao Kuangyin",
            "zh": "赵匡胤"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " chooses dialogue over "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "conflict",
            "ref": "v-conflict"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", proving that “those who win the people’s hearts win the country.” The show tells us that real peace means making sure every home stays quiet and safe."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In a world still facing conflicts today, this "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "longing"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for “Taiping”—peace—touches everyone. As one foreign viewer commented, “To understand history is to see the future.” Beyond the swords and shields, "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Swords Into Plowshares"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " reminds us that, deep down, we all share the same dream: a world without war."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
